es - 1\n    ans = INF\n    for u in range(1, N + 1):\n        if dp[full_mask][u] < ans:\n            ans = dp[full_mask][u]\n            \n    if ans == INF:\n        print(\"No\")\n    else:\n        print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
