      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    N = int(data[0])\n    \n    users = []\n    idx = 1\n    for _ in range(N):\n        S = data[idx]\n        C = int(data[idx+1])\n        idx += 2\n        users.append((S, C))\n    \n    # Sort by username lexicographically\n    users_sorted = sorted(users, key=lambda x: x[0])\n    \n    # Calculate total rating sum\n    total_rating = sum(C for _, C in users_sorted)\n    \n    # Determine winner index\n    winner_idx = total_rating % N\n    \n    # Print winner's username\n    print(users_sorted[winner_idx][0])\n\nmain()\n```",
