      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef productMatrix(grid):\n    MOD = 12345\n    n = len(grid)\n    m = len(grid[0]) if n > 0 else 0\n    \n    if n == 0 or m == 0:\n        return []\n    \n    # Flatten grid to 1D\n    flat = []\n    for row in grid:\n        flat.extend(row)\n    \n    total = len(flat)\n    \n    # Calculate prefix products\n    prefix = [1] * total\n    for i in range(1, total):\n        prefix[i] = (prefix[i-1] * flat[i-1]) % MOD\n    \n    # Calculate suffix products\n    suffix = [1] * total\n    for i in range(total - 2, -1, -1):\n        suffix[i] = (suffix[i+1] * flat[i+1]) % MOD\n    \n    # Calculate result\n    result_flat = [(prefix[i] * suffix[i]) % MOD for i in range(total)]\n    \n    # Reshape to 2D\n    result = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        row = []\n        for j in range(m):\n            row.append(result_flat[i * m + j])\n        result.append(row)\n    \n    return result\n```",
