      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef punishmentNumber(n: int) -> int:\n    def can_partition(square_str, target, start):\n        if start == len(square_str):\n            return target == 0\n        if target < 0:\n            return False\n        for end in range(start + 1, len(square_str) + 1):\n            sub = int(square_str[start:end])\n            if can_partition(square_str, target - sub, end):\n                return True\n        return False\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        square = i * i\n        square_str = str(square)\n        if can_partition(square_str, i, 0):\n            total += square\n    return total\n```",
