n0\n\nSample Output 2\n\n6 5 4 3 2\n\nSample Input 3\n\n8\r\n1 5\r\n1 6\r\n1 7\r\n1 8\r\n0\r\n0\r\n0\r\n0\n\nSample Output 3\n\n5",
