      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    \n    iterator = iter(input_data)\n    try:\n        N = int(next(iterator))\n        X = int(next(iterator))\n        A = []\n        for _ in range(N - 1):\n            A.append(int(next(iterator)))\n    except StopIteration:\n        return\n\n    # We need to find the minimum score s in [0, 100] for round N\n    # such that the sum of the middle N-2 scores (excluding min and max) is >= X.\n    \n    # Let the full list of scores be A + [s].\n    # Sort the full list.\n    # Final grade = sum of elements from index 1 to N-2 (0-indexed).\n    # i.e., excluding the smallest (index 0) and largest (index N-1).\n    \n    # Since N is small (up to 100), we can iterate s from 0 to 100.\n    \n    best_s = -1\n    \n    # Pre-sort A to help with efficiency, though brute force over s is fine.\n    A_sorted = sorted(A)\n    \n    found = False\n    for s in range(101):\n        # Create the list of all scores\n        current_scores = A_sorted.copy()\n        # Insert s into the sorted list to maintain order\n        # Since A_sorted is sorted, we can use bisect or just insert manually.\n        # Given N <= 100, simple insertion is fast enough.\n        \n        # Find position to insert s\n        inserted = False\n        new_scores = []\n        for val in A_sorted:\n            if not inserted and s < val:\n                new_scores.append(s)\n                inserted = True\n            new_scores.append(val)\n        if not inserted:\n            new_scores.append(s)\n            \n        # Calculate final grade: sum of new_scores[1:-1]\n        # Because new_scores is sorted, min is at 0, max is at N-1.\n        # We exclude index 0 and index N-1.\n        \n        current_sum = sum(new_scores[1:-1])\n        \n        if current_sum >= X:\n            best_s = s\n            found = True\n            break\n            \n    if found:\n        print(best_s)\n    else:\n        print(-1)\n\nsolve()\n```",
