      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minOperations(nums: list[int], k: int) -> int:\n    current_xor = 0\n    for num in nums:\n        current_xor ^= num\n    \n    diff = current_xor ^ k\n    count = 0\n    while diff > 0:\n        count += diff & 1\n        diff >>= 1\n    return count\n```",
