      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maxDistance(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    def is_prime(n: int) -> bool:\n        if n < 2:\n            return False\n        if n == 2:\n            return True\n        if n % 2 == 0:\n            return False\n        i = 3\n        while i * i <= n:\n            if n % i == 0:\n                return False\n            i += 2\n        return True\n    \n    first_idx = None\n    last_idx = None\n    \n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        if is_prime(num):\n            if first_idx is None:\n                first_idx = i\n            last_idx = i\n    \n    if first_idx is None:\n        return 0\n    \n    return last_idx - first_idx\n```",
