      "generated_answer": "To determine the minimum probability, we compare the expected utility of betting against the utility of not betting. With a logarithmic utility function $U(W) = \\ln(W)$, the condition for accepting the even-money bet is $p \\ln(1,100,000) + (1-p) \\ln(900,000) \\ge \\ln(1,000,000)$. Solving for $p$ yields approximately $0.525$.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
