930$. I calculated $40,930$ earlier. $72,600 * 0.5 = 36,300$. $72,600 * 0.05 = 3,630$. $36,300 + 3,630 = 39,930$. Yes, $39,930$ is correct. My mental math was wrong. So COGS is $39,930$. Ending Inventory = $30,156 + 28,300 - 39,930 = 58,456 - 39,930 = 18,526$. This matches Option G.\n\n\\boxed{G}",
