    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which one of the following political leaders could not be termed a 'transformational' leader?\n\nOptions: \nA. Barack Obama\nB. Winston Churchill\nC. Franklin D. Roosevelt\nD. Martin Luther King Jr.\nE. Mikhail Gorbachov\nF. Nelson Mandela\nG. Mahatma Gandhi\nH. Jawaharlal Nehru\nI. Bill Clinton\nJ. Margaret Thatcher\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
