or recipients. It is a secular organization, but one that grew out of Mintie's religious convictions. \nQuestion: What was offered to Mintie in March of 2001?\n\nProvided Answer: \n\n Is the provided answer correct? Provide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct choice. ",
